<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79102" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραχράομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>misuse, abuse</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ μὲν οὐ χρῶνται, οἱ δὲ παραχρῶνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					56
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῶ μὴ παραχρώμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.61
				</span></i>
			 : c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῷ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.37.9
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὥσπερ ἀνδραπόδοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.93
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐς τοὺς συμμάχους</span>
			<i>deal wrongly</i> or <i>unworthily</i> with them, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.92
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>treat with contempt, disregard</i>, c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.159
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.20
			</span></i> : part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραχρεώμενοι</span>, abs., of combatants,
				<i>fighting without thought of life, setting nothing by their
				life</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.223
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>use for a further</i> or <i>subsidiary purpose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				688a23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>B.</b>
			
				Act.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραχράω</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραχρηστηριάζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				<u>Chr.</u>
				9.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
